To configure the scratch org for Southern Cross Logistics, `config/project-scratch-def.json` maps the supported requirements to top-level `ScratchOrgInfo` properties and `CompanySettings`:

- **`orgName` & `edition`**: Set to `"Southern Cross Logistics"` and `"Enterprise"`.
- **`adminEmail`**: Set to `"sf-admins@southerncross.example"` so signup and login notifications route to the shared admin address instead of the CLI user creating the scratch org.
